String {
    key = "mechlopedia.mech.wolfhound.description"
    text = "A Light 'Mech built more for combat than scouting, the Wolfhound design complements an array of energy weapons with excellent armor for a 'Mech in its class.\n\nTough, fast, and jump capable, the Wolfhound excels at base assault operations and combat in rugged terrain. Multiple lasers allow it to dispatch tanks and combat vehicles quickly, while the Large Laser allows it to combat 'Mech threats.\n\nConsidered by many experts as a high-performance unit, the Wolfhound is employed by some of the most famous mercenaries in the Inner Sphere, including the notorious Wolf's Dragoons."
    paragraphCount = 3
    paragraph0 = "A Light 'Mech built more for combat than scouting, the Wolfhound design complements an array of energy weapons with excellent armor for a 'Mech in its class."
    paragraph1 = "Tough, fast, and jump capable, the Wolfhound excels at base assault operations and combat in rugged terrain. Multiple lasers allow it to dispatch tanks and combat vehicles quickly, while the Large Laser allows it to combat 'Mech threats."
    paragraph2 = "Considered by many experts as a high-performance unit, the Wolfhound is employed by some of the most famous mercenaries in the Inner Sphere, including the notorious Wolf's Dragoons."
